   NOV 18-20, 2019},
Abstract = {Secure cloud storage is considered as one of the most important problems
   that both businesses and end-users take into account before moving their
   private data to the cloud. Lately, we have seen some interesting
   approaches that are based either on the promising concept of Symmetric
   Searchable Encryption (SSE) or on the well-studied field of
   Attribute-Based Encryption (ABE). Our construction, MicroSCOPE, combines
   both ABE and SSE to utilize the advantages of each technique. Finally,
   we enhance our construction with an access control mechanism by
   utilizing the functionality provided by SGX.},
