   computing; vehicular networking; sensing capacities; vehicle-to-vehicle;
   available roadside infrastructure; traffic management; road safety;
   vehicular communication; vehicular resources; internet of things
   environment; scalable platform; intelligent transport systems; chaotic
   map-based mutual authentication framework; secure mutual authentication
