   Fu, Junsong, Beijing Univ Posts \& Telecommun, Sch Cyberspace Secur, Beijing 100876, Peoples R China.
   Deng, Lunzhi, Guizhou Normal Univ, Sch Math Sci, Guiyang 550001, Peoples R China.},
DOI = {10.1109/TPDS.2025.3580407},
ISSN = {1045-9219},
